From bf826fc19f5de7d6ac0ea8f68ea093272b21529d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerd Hoffmann <kraxel@redhat.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 08:24:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] OvmfPkg/IntelTdx: use GenericQemuLoadImageLib

Replace X86QemuLoadImageLib with GenericQemuLoadImageLib.  This removes
the legacy linux kernel loader and effectively renders prehistoric linux
kernels (which do not have the EFI stub and can not be loaded as EFI
binaries) unsupported.

Running in a TDX guest requires a relatively recent linux kernel anyway,
so there is little reason to care about backward compatibility with very
old linux kernels.

Signed-off-by: Gerd Hoffmann <kraxel@redhat.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/tianocore/edk2/commit/bf826fc19f5de7d6ac0ea8f68ea093272b21529d]

---
 OvmfPkg/IntelTdx/IntelTdxX64.dsc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/OvmfPkg/IntelTdx/IntelTdxX64.dsc b/OvmfPkg/IntelTdx/IntelTdxX64.dsc
index 4f63a12640..bee2b0de82 100644
--- a/OvmfPkg/IntelTdx/IntelTdxX64.dsc
+++ b/OvmfPkg/IntelTdx/IntelTdxX64.dsc
@@ -327,7 +327,7 @@
   MpInitLib|UefiCpuPkg/Library/MpInitLib/DxeMpInitLib.inf
   NestedInterruptTplLib|OvmfPkg/Library/NestedInterruptTplLib/NestedInterruptTplLib.inf
   QemuFwCfgS3Lib|OvmfPkg/Library/QemuFwCfgS3Lib/DxeQemuFwCfgS3LibFwCfg.inf
-  QemuLoadImageLib|OvmfPkg/Library/X86QemuLoadImageLib/X86QemuLoadImageLib.inf
+  QemuLoadImageLib|OvmfPkg/Library/GenericQemuLoadImageLib/GenericQemuLoadImageLib.inf
   TdxMeasurementLib|OvmfPkg/IntelTdx/TdxMeasurementLib/DxeTdxMeasurementLib.inf
 
 [LibraryClasses.common.UEFI_APPLICATION]
